WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.078 --> 00:00:06.236
Roxy was with her parents at Metro City Music Hall.

2
00:00:06.237 --> 00:00:10.701
"This show will be so lame!" Roxy said.

3
00:00:10.702 --> 00:00:17.223
"Don't be silly," her mom said. "You'll love it!"

4
00:00:17.224 --> 00:00:21.908
The Metro City Rocket Dancers were performing their holiday show.

5
00:00:21.909 --> 00:00:27.063
"They always put on a great show." Roxy's dad chuckled.

6
00:00:27.064 --> 00:00:30.448
"This year they're dressed like someone you know."

7
00:00:30.449 --> 00:00:32.765
Roxy rolled her eyes.

8
00:00:32.766 --> 00:00:35.983
The dancers always wore fancy costumes.

9
00:00:35.984 --> 00:00:40.166
In this year's show, they were all dressed like Rocket Girl.

10
00:00:40.167 --> 00:00:44.745
Roxy and her parents found their seats.

11
00:00:44.746 --> 00:00:47.116
Roxy looked at her watch.

12
00:00:47.117 --> 00:00:52.239
"Maybe Mayor Bloom will call with an emergency," she thought.

13
00:00:52.240 --> 00:00:57.309
"Then I'll get to leave."

14
00:00:57.310 --> 00:01:03.064
But the mayor didn't call.

15
00:01:03.065 --> 00:01:05.893
Roxy called him instead.

16
00:01:05.894 --> 00:01:11.287
"Rocket Girl," the mayor said. "What's wrong?"

17
00:01:11.288 --> 00:01:15.034
"Um, are there any emergencies?" Roxy whispered.

18
00:01:15.035 --> 00:01:18.049
"Do you need me to do anything?"

19
00:01:18.050 --> 00:01:20.389
Mayor Bloom scratched his head.

20
00:01:20.390 --> 00:01:27.888
"I don't think so. Why? Is there a problem I don't know about?"

21
00:01:27.889 --> 00:01:30.024
Now he looked nervous.

22
00:01:30.025 --> 00:01:36.057
Roxy sighed. "No. Sorry, I'm just bored.

23
00:01:36.058 --> 00:01:42.614
Call if you need me." She closed the watch.

24
00:01:42.615 --> 00:01:44.528
The lights dimmed.

25
00:01:44.529 --> 00:01:48.380
"Ladies and gentlemen!" a voice said.

26
00:01:48.381 --> 00:01:53.512
"Please welcome the Metro City Rocket Dancers!"

27
00:01:53.513 --> 00:01:57.940
The curtains opened. Music played.

28
00:01:57.941 --> 00:02:00.774
A line of dancers appeared on the stage.

29
00:02:00.775 --> 00:02:04.193
They wore Rocket Girl costumes.

30
00:02:04.194 --> 00:02:08.020
The show told a story about Rocket Girl saving the holidays.

31
00:02:08.021 --> 00:02:11.192
The stage had a city scene with stores.

32
00:02:11.193 --> 00:02:13.670
Actors pretended to shop.

33
00:02:13.671 --> 00:02:17.999
The audience seemed to love it. But Roxy didn't.

34
00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:23.225
"This is boring," she thought.

35
00:02:23.226 --> 00:02:27.473
Suddenly she saw a man sneaking toward the stage.

36
00:02:27.474 --> 00:02:31.823
He had a beard. A big tank was strapped to his back.

37
00:02:31.824 --> 00:02:38.284
Roxy gasped. "Freddie Freeze!"

38
00:02:38.285 --> 00:02:44.475
She ran into the lobby, changed into Rocket Girl, and then hurried back.

39
00:02:44.476 --> 00:02:47.005
Now Freddie Freeze was singing.

40
00:02:47.006 --> 00:02:55.355
"The holidays can be so nice, but I will turn you all to ice!"

41
00:02:55.356 --> 00:02:57.907
The actors pretended to be frozen.

42
00:02:57.917 --> 00:03:04.102
Roxy sighed. "That's not the real Freddie Freeze.

43
00:03:04.103 --> 00:03:08.728
He's just part of the show."

44
00:03:08.729 --> 00:03:10.999
Roxy returned to her seat.

45
00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:14.651
The Rocket Dancers danced toward the fake Freddie Freeze.

46
00:03:14.652 --> 00:03:17.513
They pretended to shoot eye laser beams.

47
00:03:17.514 --> 00:03:19.433
Freddie Freeze sang.

48
00:03:19.434 --> 00:03:35.047
"My evil plan! It did fail! Now I'll spend some time in jail!"

49
00:03:35.048 --> 00:03:40.841
Finally the show was over.

50
00:03:40.842 --> 00:03:50.035
"That was so cheesy," Roxy thought. "I never want to see that show again!"

51
00:03:50.036 --> 00:03:56.326
The next day in school, Principal Penn made an announcement.

52
00:03:56.327 --> 00:04:00.665
"Good news! We're taking a field trip on Friday.

53
00:04:00.666 --> 00:04:05.615
We're going to see the Metro City Rocket Dancers!"

54
00:04:05.616 --> 00:04:10.930
Roxy groaned. "Ugh."

